    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><computeroutput><ref refid="classthrust_1_1device__malloc__allocator" kindref="compound">device_malloc_allocator</ref></computeroutput> is a device memory allocator that employs the <computeroutput>device_malloc</computeroutput> function for allocation.</para>
<para><computeroutput><ref refid="classthrust_1_1device__malloc__allocator" kindref="compound">device_malloc_allocator</ref></computeroutput> is deprecated in favor of <computeroutput><ref refid="namespacethrust_1_1mr" kindref="compound">thrust::mr</ref></computeroutput> memory resource-based allocators.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para>device_malloc </para>
</simplesect>
